Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:09.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the ultimate form of self-transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The ultimate manifestation of undying passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:20.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,A form of art, where the body is a\Ncanvas to express the artist's devotion...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,...which hundreds of thousands admire and pursue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:29.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is a story...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,A story about young women who cosplay...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,...and the love and passion they share.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:40.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:46.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Make me look cute, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.04,0:02:25.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(281.6,403.2)}{\an7}New Student from Another Dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:33.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(934.4,93.6)}{\an7}Club Building A
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:40.00,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,151.2)}{\an7}Manga Club
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:39.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, you can't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:48.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:53.54,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,165.6)}{\an7}The Ashford Chronicles
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:52.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That scene always hits so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:55.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have zero interest in 3D girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:59.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a second-year in high school,\Nand I already know I'll never be interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:03.42,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(870.4,201.6)}{\an7}good luck\N{\pos(512,432)}{\an7}ME (8)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,My mom abandoned me to be with some guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:08.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,In grade school, I asked out the girl I liked,\Nonly to be bullied for being a "creep."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:11.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,The girls in my class all call me a gross otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ew, barf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't give a damn about that,\Nand here's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:19.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's an angel waiting for me,\Njust one dimension away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:21.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ashford-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,My waifu, Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:27.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's sweet and pure,\Nand only has eyes for the main character.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:30.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's so in love she dies for him\Nand comes back as an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:33.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Know any girls like that in real life?\NI didn't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:35.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why she's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:38.88,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204.8,64.8)}{\an7}Club Building
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:38.88,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,331.2)}{\an7}New Members Welcome!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.79,0:03:41.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,All the other club members did, too,\Nbut they graduated last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:42.71,Q8,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Sorry, coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:42.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's fine, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.71,0:03:44.83,Q8,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Sorry, coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.71,0:03:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,'cause 3D girls will never bother me in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:45.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,'cause 3D girls will never bother me in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:52.71,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(128,187.2)}{\an7}Manga Club
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:03:59.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.79,0:04:04.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you taking new members?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.71,0:04:07.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,A 3D girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Ririsa Amano.\NI'm a first year, and I really love manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.33,0:04:16.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet she only likes shoujo bullcrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:18.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,This club is for ass and titties,\Nand the guys who love 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way am I letting some girl\Nruin my secret sexy sanctuary!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:24.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll come up with some excuse\Nto get her out of here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,These are so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Jackpot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:32.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Those aren't your baby sister's dolls, no, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a limited-edition strippable figurine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:46.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now she'll get it.\NShe'll know she doesn't belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,This figurine's based on art by a hentai manga-ka\Nfrom the fifth anniversary booklet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:00.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,How'd you know that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The face is cute and the costume looks great,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,but why'd they give her\Nboring white panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:07.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Obviously they weren't visible\Nin the original design,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.88,0:05:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,but if I were Liliel,\NI would've gone with black lace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.54,0:05:12.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:18.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That would've made her look so much sexier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's so right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:21.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, why am I agreeing with her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:23.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like yeah, she's right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.25,0:05:27.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!\NWe literally just met and I'm being all weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.25,0:05:28.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, nah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:30.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't judge her panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.50,0:05:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's got their own style,\Nand there's a style for everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:34.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's not why I'm weirded out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:37.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I didn't think girls could even be into this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:41.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've always been into cute and sexy characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I know, it's weird, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's not weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:50.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it means we've got\Nsomething in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.71,0:05:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, it seems like you know\Na lot about Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:55.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:57.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no one who loves her more than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:00.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.33,0:06:04.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's every man's fantasy\Nrolled into one perfect package!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:07.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What would a girl know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Try me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:15.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've always liked heroines\Ndesigned for a male audience!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I kinda self-insert into them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:23.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,They might be fictional, but all the things\Nboys like about them are real!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:27.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel is cute, and sexy,\Nand is always turning heads...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:28.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's a little awkward,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:31.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,but she wears her heart on her sleeve,\Nand everyone loves her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:33.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why I fell in love with her, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:34.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,And not just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.71,0:06:36.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to BE Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:37.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You want to WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd meet someone\Nwho loved Liliel as much as I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:44.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,But she's still one dimension too many!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:45.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:49.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the old movie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've seen the old movie, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The team behind the legendary OVA\Nreunited to create another masterpiece!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.21,0:06:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Taniguchi's script brought Liliel\Ninto the spotlight for the first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:02.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nakamura's gorgeous sakuga!\NIt's so smooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:03.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:05.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,And watch this effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:06.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here comes that famous scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:13.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:18.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dammit, she's the perfect Liliel fan!\NWhy does she have to be a girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:21.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could have another club member\Nto gush over Liliel with...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:24.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd kill for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:26.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But she's still 3D!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.96,0:07:28.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:33.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, could you help me with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.25,0:07:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.17,0:07:37.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's this weird hobby I'm into...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never told anyone about it, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:43.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I'm really worried it'll weird you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:45.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're sorely mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.25,0:07:48.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're quoting Ash-sama from Episode 13!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.63,0:07:49.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, you got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You think I'd get weirded out by that?\NMe, Okumura?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:07:59.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,A real otaku NEVER judges\Nsomeone by the things they love!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.17,0:08:03.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That love, that passion, is our heart and soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is what makes us otaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:10.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,My senpai told me that once,\Nand now I get to tell her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.13,0:08:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, why am I being so supportive?!\NWasn't I trying to get rid of her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:22.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.71,0:08:25.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,G-give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I show you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.25,0:08:33.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are these DVDs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.67,0:08:36.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, is this porn?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:42.13,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(140.8,115.2)}{\an7}Milky\N{\pos(102.4,165.6)}{\an7}Succubus
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.67,0:08:39.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it's cosplay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:41.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're called cosroms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:44.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're collections of cosplay photos and videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:48.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to make one of my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:50.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:09:00.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(371.2,144)}{\an7}Manga\N{\pos(384,194.4)}{\an7}Club
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.38,0:09:01.88,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,115.2)}{\an7}Milky Succubus
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:04.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you wanna do this? Wear this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:07.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, didn't you just say you wouldn't judge?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:11.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-right, of course not! This is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.79,0:09:14.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're gonna let people see this, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:20.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was a kid,\NI've loved the costumes manga characters wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:25.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd always picture myself wearing them,\Nespecially if they were cute and sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:32.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I figured most people would look down on me,\Nso I kept it a secret for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:33.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:36.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I went to my first in-person event.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I can't believe they're wearing that in public...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,And there are so many other women here to see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm such a huge fan!\NYour last ROM was so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know, right?!\NI really focused on my ass for this new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:51.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,So it's okay for girls to\Ntalk about this stuff, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:53.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, sweetie, how old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.79,0:09:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.21,0:10:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is a softcore event, so come back\Nwhen you're in high school, mmkay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's when I realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:12.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's awesome when people can openly\Nand proudly pursue their passions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,When no one can stop them\Nfrom doing what they love,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:16.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,no matter what they say!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:22.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna be proud of what I like\Nand make a cosrom with Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.38,0:10:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,With Liliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, I did say I wouldn't judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:35.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:38.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking me so seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What did you need help with?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.88,0:10:42.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you let me join the club...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:53.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Will you take pictures of me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:55.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! Why me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:59.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Usually you'd find a photographer online,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I dunno about being alone with a stranger...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.25,0:11:06.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that makes sense.\NStill, I barely know how to use a camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's fine! I'm totally new to this, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:11.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,All we need is passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:16.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd rather take pictures with someone\Nwho shares my love for Liliel, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We do share that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:27.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew I wanted to make my own ROM\Nonce I started high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:27.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(332.8,115.2)}{\an7}EXTRACURRICULAR CLUB GUIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:31.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I came here to take the entry exam,\NI saw this room...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:36.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec! That's a Liliel poster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I felt like fate was calling me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.21,0:11:43.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Think I'm ready to die now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:49.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're such a huge Liliel fan,\Nand you heard me out and took me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:53.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel like I can trust you with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:55.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,So... can I join?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.13,0:12:02.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I let her join...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:05.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,For real, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:18.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay's a big part of the manga world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:25.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our club would love to have an otaku like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.67,0:12:29.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your cosplay plans can be part of\Nour sanctioned club activities!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.75,0:12:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you won't have to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:34.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel is my waifu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:37.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,3D women don't affect me\Nor attract me in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:43.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wear all the sexy outfits you want,\NI guarantee you I won't feel a thing for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:46.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're a legend! An otaku legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.21,0:12:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, you flatter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is fine. Her gender aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.63,0:12:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see now she's a real otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:58.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hell, it sounds like it's gonna be\Nanother great year of being an otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.83,0:12:59.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.29,0:13:03.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's get right to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:05.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.83,0:13:10.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I figured I should let you see what I have,\Nso I brought one of my costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you're gonna put it on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sorry, there wasn't a good place to change!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:18.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We don't have curtains on our window!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, we can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.13,0:13:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:30.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm freaking out because of how\Nsuddenly that happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.29,0:13:34.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not because I'm attracted to 3DPD!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:54.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can look now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.25,0:14:20.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ashford-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:21.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.58,0:14:31.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-senpai! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.88,0:14:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:37.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nope. I am so not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holy shit. It's her. It's Liliel, in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:39.96,Q8,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:39.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holy shit. It's her. It's Liliel, in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holy shit. It's her. It's Liliel, in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:43.17,Q8,,0,0,0,,I went with her standard angel outfit first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.17,0:14:44.58,Q8,,0,0,0,,I went with her standard angel outfit first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.17,0:14:44.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,The real Liliel is standing right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:45.54,Q8,,0,0,0,,Well? I made sure all the details were perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:45.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The real Liliel is standing right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:47.21,Q8,,0,0,0,,Well? I made sure all the details were perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:47.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did I slip into the 2D world somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:50.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shit! I gotta snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:52.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.13,0:14:53.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:14:57.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I went with these panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:14:58.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, they're part of the costume, too,\Nso it's not like this is anything weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-y-yep, not weird at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:08.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can see her butt all throughout\Nthe battle in Chapter 128,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I thought of going for a thong,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I think a bikini cut is\Nway more in-character for Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.79,0:15:17.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?\NI want to hear your opinion!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.29,0:15:21.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sure. It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:24.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,My waifu is 2D... 3D girls are disgusting...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.46,0:15:30.29,Q8,,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.46,0:15:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,My waifu is 2D... 3D girls are disgusting...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,My waifu is 2D... 3D girls are disgusting...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:32.75,Q8,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,My waifu is 2D... 3D girls are disgusting...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:35.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:39.38,Q11,,0,0,0,,Senpai, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:40.83,Q8,,0,0,0,,Senpai, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:44.33,Q8,,0,0,0,,You must be feeling sick! I'm sorry if I made it worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:44.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,2.5D girls are... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:49.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get started tomorrow, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:54.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess I won't know till I give 'em a try...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.17,0:15:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:07.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yesterday was a mess.\NI can't believe I let her join...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not in love with her, am I?! Me?!\NLusting after a filthy 3D girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:15.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I swore I'd be loyal to Liliel forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.88,0:16:20.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-hey there, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh... h-hey, Amano-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:25.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, you can call me Ririsa,\Nsince I'm your kohai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:26.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, Ririsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:33.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you watching the OVA?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:35.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:37.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could never get my hands on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's pretty old.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,A shame, really, since there are so many\Nscenes that make it a work of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:44.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course you'd know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.88,0:16:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.33,0:16:48.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-well, if you insist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:53.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Up until now, she's been feeling overwhelmed\Nby the pressure to help her friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.67,0:16:56.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,but right here, she finally realizes how much\Nher friends have been helping her, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.58,0:16:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,but she doesn't say it out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:16:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:00.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cause you can see it on her face! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forget flashy lasers or smooth motion,\Nthis attention to detail is godlike animation!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:05.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do you know so much?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:07.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've done my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:09.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:12.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,How is this part of your research?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:14.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wanna see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:17.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, you're cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:18.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nope, this is all in the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:20.58,Q8,,0,0,0,,Then I'm gonna pick a different fighter next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:20.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holy shit! This is so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:20.96,Q8,,0,0,0,,either Nasu or Gorgon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:20.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holy shit! This is so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:21.88,Q8,,0,0,0,,either Nasu or Gorgon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always wanted a cool kohai like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always wanted a cool kohai like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never should've worried about her.\NShe's the perfect otaku buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.33,0:17:29.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, mind if I try pausing a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.29,0:17:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:36.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can see her undies in a few frames!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:38.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is she, a horny thirteen-year-old boy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:41.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whenever I see a sexy outfit,\NI have to write down all the little details!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:47.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want my cosplays to be\Nas realistic as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:50.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That way, I can bring\Neach character into real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:53.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want people to see my cosplay
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.25,0:17:55.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,and think their favorite character\Nreally exists before them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:17:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why I reacted to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.29,0:18:04.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need to get into my cosplay, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I get changed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:07.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're already changing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:09.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.29,0:18:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm just impressed by how\Nhigh-quality her cosplay was!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:14.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am NOT in love with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.08,0:18:15.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for being patient!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am not...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.21,0:18:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Today, I went with the training outfit\Nfrom the Angel Academy spin-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:28.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you need me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:30.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:33.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could you take some pictures of me,\Njust on your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.25,0:18:34.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, but I don't know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.88,0:18:36.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just let your love for Liliel guide you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:44.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll pose here.\NYou just keep clicking away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.67,0:18:45.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay...
