Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:04.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the front page from\NChapter 81 of the spin-off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:06.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,In real life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:10.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:15.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:18.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perfect...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.25,0:19:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.92,0:19:24.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna try another costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, you have more?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,All ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.38,0:19:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's her third squad uniform!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.46,0:19:38.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn, I have no idea what angles\Nwill make her look good,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,but this is actually really fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do I look? Can I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:44.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.17,0:19:47.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,These are incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:50.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're awesome, Senpai!\NMy Liliel looks mega cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:52.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess my passion did guide me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew it would! See this first pose?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It looks just like the art from that chapter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:03.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can feel my love\Nfor Liliel coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:06.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I asked you to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:08.25,Q11,,0,0,0,,This one's good, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.25,0:20:09.21,Q8,,0,0,0,,This one's good, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.25,0:20:09.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn, she really does love Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:11.04,Q8,,0,0,0,,And this one, too! The next few are so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn, she really does love Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.96,Q8,,0,0,0,,And this one, too! The next few are so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why she found the courage to ask me to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's already this late?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.79,0:20:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll change back into my uniform, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.54,0:20:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I promised her I'd never feel a thing from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.00,0:20:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no going back on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:29.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's just the coolest kohai\NI could ever ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:32.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll support her with the purest intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:34.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,My zipper's kinda stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:39.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could you help me undress?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:41.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,HELP YOU WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:41.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.4,338.4)}{\an7}HELP YOU WHAT!!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.33,0:20:44.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just give the zipper a tug!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:45.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,See, right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, sure, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.08,0:20:51.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's really stuck...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I made it myself,\Nso it's probably a little janky-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:00.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.67,0:21:02.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah, I didn't see shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.50,0:21:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lili-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.29,0:21:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, uh, Ririsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:20.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm okay. Thanks for catching me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:24.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,...Ashford-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.08,0:21:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Very funny, Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.79,0:21:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.83,0:21:35.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, uh... Could you let go of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.21,0:21:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't mean to!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.92,0:21:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.17,0:21:46.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take some time to change,\Nso feel free to head out without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:48.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You got it! Okay, bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.17,0:21:53.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.25,0:22:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's a lot stronger than he looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.13,0:22:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why's my heart racing so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.67,0:22:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Something's off...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.25,0:22:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I coming down with a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.63,0:22:24.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd better take some medicine\Nwhen I get home!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:24:01.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,388.8)}{\an7}Cosplay Group Potential?
